敵關羽而被殺。","en":"A Yellow Turban officer. He led one hundred thousand Yellow Turban troops to attack Beihai and demanded grain from Kong Rong, the Governor of Beihai. Kong Rong sent Zong Bao to fight him, but Guan Hai slew Zong Bao. While Kong Rong was besieged, Taishi Ci broke through the encirclement and sought Liu Bei's aid. After Liu Bei arrived with Guan Yu and Zhang Fei to the rescue, Guan Hai was no match for Guan Yu and was slain in combat.","jp":"黄巾軍の武将。10万の黄巾軍を率いて北海に攻め入り、北海太守の孔融に食糧を要求した。孔融は宗宝を迎撃に向かわせたが、管亥に討ち取られた。孔融が城を包囲される中、太史慈が包囲を突破。関羽や張飛を率いた劉備に救出を求め、駆けつけた劉備軍の関羽に敵わず討ち取られた。","kr":"황건적의 무장. 십만 황건적을 이끌고 북해를 침범하여 북해태수 공융에게 식량을 요구했다. 공융이 종보를 보내 맞서게 했으나 관해에게 베였다. 공융이 성에 포위되자 태사자가 포위를 뚫고 탈출했다. 이후 유비가 관우, 장비를 이끌고 와 구출하자, 관해는 관우를 당해내지 못하고 죽임을 당했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10545","remark":"","surname":"管","surnameTc":"管","surnameEn":"Guan","surnameJp":"管","surnameKr":"관","surnameOther":"","name":"亥","nameTc":"亥","nameEn":"Hai","nameJp":"亥","nameKr":"해","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"管亥","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"1","recruit":"0","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1017","gender":"0","rule":"70","force":"82","wise":"10","politics":"5","charm":"25","will":"38","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"11","wiseTalent":"1","politicsTalent":"1","charmTalent":"1","willTalent":"3","weaponMaster":"24/24/78/24/24/2/50/24","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"1010105;1004202","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1013005","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4900","battleSoulPoint":"6700","debateSoulPoint":"100","strategy":"1010915","strategy2":"1000905;1000115","professions":"0/2/3/0/2/0/2/0/0/0/1/1/2/0/2/0/0/0/0/0/0/1/1/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality"